title Grid Balancing Recommendation Business Process

actor Operator
participant Camunda
participant Kong
participant "Grid Balancing Service" as Grid
participant Database
participant Kafka

Operator->Camunda: Start process\n(proceed: confirmed)

Camunda->Kong: POST /GridBalancing/recommend
Kong->Grid: Forward Request
activate Grid

Grid->Database: Query Telemetry, GridZone\nand AssetLink data
Database-->Grid: Zone readings, zone config,\nactive links

note right of Grid: Compute net_load per zone\nIdentify deficit / surplus pairs\n(neighbouring postal codes, ≤1 apart)

Grid->Database: INSERT recommendations\n(deficitZoneId, surplusZoneId, recommendedActionKw)
Database-->Grid: OK (recommendation IDs)

Grid->Kafka: Publish to\ngrid-balancing-recommendation topic

Grid-->Kong: 200 OK - recommendations list\n[{id, deficitZoneId, surplusZoneId, recommendedActionKw}]
deactivate Grid
Kong-->Camunda: Forward Response


Camunda->Operator: Show recommendations\n(pick selectedRecommendationId, accept: true/false)
Operator->Camunda: Submit decision

alt accept = true
  Camunda->Kong: POST /GridBalancing/act/{selectedRecommendationId}
  note right of Kong: Moves a prosumer AssetLink\nfrom surplus zone to deficit zone\n(see Grid-Balancing-Act diagram)
  Kong-->Camunda: 200 OK - action summary
  Camunda->Operator: Confirm action executed
  Operator->Camunda: Confirm
else accept = false
  note right of Camunda: Process ends - Recommendation Rejected
end
